---
/**
 * src/pages/en/doctors/index.astro
 * Nuhavi Health — Clinical Faculty & Specialist Review Network
 *
 * Compliance:
 * - Independent doctor-led review framework.
 * - Zero commercial rankings or promotional physician sponsorship.
 * - Outlines 7-point clinical vetting standard for hospital specialists.
 */
import BaseLayout from '../../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Clinical Specialists & Review Network | Nuhavi Health"
  description="How Nuhavi coordinates independent specialist reviews across accredited Indian tertiary hospitals without commercial bias or promotional rankings."
  lang="en"
>
  <main class="page-container" id="main-content">
    <div class="container main-content">
      <div class="gold-rule" aria-hidden="true"></div>

      <header class="page-header">
        <div class="badge-row">
          <span class="hub-badge">Clinical Governance & Specialist Network</span>
        </div>
        <h1 class="page-title">Independent Medical Specialist Review</h1>
        <p class="page-deck">
          Nuhavi Health coordinates independent second opinions and clinical reviews directly with department leads and multidisciplinary boards at accredited Indian tertiary hospitals — without commercial promotion or sponsored physician rankings.
        </p>
      </header>

      <!-- Section: Clinical Governance Principles -->
      <section class="governance-grid">
        <div class="gov-card">
          <div class="gov-icon" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#0F2340" stroke-width="2">
              <path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"></path>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3>Multidisciplinary Board Reviews</h3>
          <p>
            Complex cases — especially oncology, organ transplantation, and neurosurgery — are reviewed by hospital Tumour Boards and multi-specialty panels rather than a single isolated practitioner.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="gov-card">
          <div class="gov-icon" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#0F2340" stroke-width="2">
              <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle>
              <line x1="4.93" y1="4.93" x2="19.07" y2="19.07"></line>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3>Zero Paid Rankings or Endorsements</h3>
          <p>
            We strictly reject "Top Doctor" advertising or paid placement. Specialists are engaged exclusively based on their clinical expertise, hospital technological capabilities, and relevance to your diagnosis.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="gov-card">
          <div class="gov-icon" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#0F2340" stroke-width="2">
              <path d="M14 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z"></path>
              <polyline points="14 2 14 8 20 8"></polyline>
              <line x1="16" y1="13" x2="8" y2="13"></line>
              <line x1="16" y1="17" x2="8" y2="17"></line>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3>Direct Written Second Opinions</h3>
          <p>
            You receive official signed preliminary review letters on hospital letterhead outlining the specialist's clinical opinion, recommended diagnostics, and expected inpatient duration.
          </p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- Section: 7-Point Specialist Selection Standard -->
      <section class="standards-section">
        <h2 class="section-title">The 7-Point Clinical Vetting Standard</h2>
        <p class="section-subtext">
          Every senior specialist in our hospital coordination network meets strict benchmark standards verified by our clinical governance team:
        </p>

        <ol class="standards-list">
          <li class="standard-item">
            <span class="standard-num">01</span>
            <div class="standard-text">
              <h4>Accredited Super-Specialty Qualifications</h4>
              <p>Specialists hold recognized postgraduate and super-specialty degrees (MCh, DM, DNB, FRCS, American Board or equivalent fellowship credentials).</p>
            </div>
          </li>
          <li class="standard-item">
            <span class="standard-num">02</span>
            <div class="standard-text">
              <h4>15+ Years Clinical Practice & High Surgical Volume</h4>
              <p>Department directors and senior consultants with extensive audited case volumes in their sub-specialised procedural domain.</p>
            </div>
          </li>
          <li class="standard-item">
            <span class="standard-num">03</span>
            <div class="standard-text">
              <h4>Institutional Affiliation with JCI / NABH Hospitals</h4>
              <p>Physicians practice within accredited tertiary medical campuses equipped with dedicated ICUs and 24/7 emergency response infrastructure.</p>
            </div>
          </li>
          <li class="standard-item">
            <span class="standard-num">04</span>
            <div class="standard-text">
              <h4>Documented Multidisciplinary Collaboration</h4>
              <p>Routine participation in institutional tumour boards, joint cardiac conferences, or transplant medical evaluation boards.</p>
            </div>
          </li>
          <li class="standard-item">
            <span class="standard-num">05</span>
            <div class="standard-text">
              <h4>Sub-Specialised Procedural Expertise</h4>
              <p>Focus on dedicated procedures (e.g., robotic joint arthroplasty, microvascular free tissue transfer, or paediatric cardiac surgery) rather than generalised surgery.</p>
            </div>
          </li>
          <li class="standard-item">
            <span class="standard-num">06</span>
            <div class="standard-text">
              <h4>Transparent Clinical Record Review</h4>
              <p>Commitment to providing written case evaluations and discussing alternative treatment modalities before international travel is arranged.</p>
            </div>
          </li>
          <li class="standard-item">
            <span class="standard-num">07</span>
            <div class="standard-text">
              <h4>Ethical Practice & Statutory Compliance</h4>
              <p>Full adherence to statutory medical laws including the Transplantation of Human Organs Act (THOA) and international patient safety protocols.</p>
            </div>
          </li>
        </ol>
      </section>

      <!-- Section: Request a Doctor Review -->
      <section class="review-cta-section">
        <div class="review-cta-inner">
          <h2>Request a Specialist Case Evaluation</h2>
          <p>
            Submit your clinical details to have your diagnostic scans and history reviewed by department leads across our accredited hospital network.
          </p>
          <a href="/en/request-opinion/" class="btn-primary cta-btn">
            <span>Request a Medical Opinion</span>
            <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5">
              <line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"></line>
              <polyline points="12 5 19 12 12 19"></polyline>
            </svg>
          </a>
        </div>
      </section>
    </div>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .page-container {
    background-color: #FFFFFF;
    color: var(--color-ink);
    padding: 48px 0 96px;
  }

  .main-content {
    max-width: 1040px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 24px;
  }

  .gold-rule {
    width: 72px;
    height: 3px;
    background-color: var(--color-brass);
    margin-bottom: 24px;
  }

  .page-header {
    margin-bottom: 56px;
  }

  .hub-badge {
    display: inline-block;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    color: var(--color-navy);
    background-color: var(--color-ivory);
    border: 1px solid rgba(168, 139, 90, 0.3);
    padding: 4px 12px;
    border-radius: var(--radius-pill);
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }

  .page-title {
    font-family: var(--font-family-heading);
    font-size: clamp(2.25rem, 4vw, 3.25rem);
    color: var(--color-navy);
    line-height: 1.15;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }

  .page-deck {
    font-size: 1.125rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--color-slate);
    max-width: 780px;
  }

  .governance-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr));
    gap: 24px;
    margin-bottom: 72px;
  }

  .gov-card {
    background-color: #FAFBFD;
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-radius: 14px;
    padding: 28px;
  }

  .gov-icon {
    width: 48px;
    height: 48px;
    border-radius: 10px;
    background-color: var(--color-ivory);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }

  .gov-card h3 {
    font-size: 1.125rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--color-navy);
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }

  .gov-card p {
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    color: var(--color-slate);
    line-height: 1.55;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .standards-section {
    margin-bottom: 72px;
  }

  .section-title {
    font-family: var(--font-family-heading);
    font-size: clamp(1.75rem, 3vw, 2.25rem);
    color: var(--color-navy);
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }

  .section-subtext {
    font-size: 1rem;
    color: var(--color-slate);
    margin-bottom: 32px;
    max-width: 760px;
  }

  .standards-list {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 0;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 16px;
  }

  .standard-item {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 20px;
    background-color: #FFFFFF;
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 20px 24px;
  }

  .standard-num {
    font-family: var(--font-family-heading);
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--color-brass);
    line-height: 1;
    min-width: 36px;
  }

  .standard-text h4 {
    font-size: 1.0625rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--color-navy);
    margin-bottom: 4px;
  }

  .standard-text p {
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    color: var(--color-slate);
    line-height: 1.5;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .review-cta-section {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0F2340 0%, #1A375E 100%);
    color: #FFFFFF;
    border-radius: 20px;
    padding: 48px 36px;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .review-cta-inner {
    max-width: 640px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .review-cta-inner h2 {
    color: #FFFFFF;
    font-family: var(--font-family-heading);
    font-size: clamp(1.75rem, 3vw, 2.25rem);
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }

  .review-cta-inner p {
    color: var(--color-mist);
    font-size: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin-bottom: 24px;
  }

  .cta-btn {
    background-color: var(--color-brass);
    color: #FFFFFF;
    padding: 14px 28px;
    border-radius: var(--radius-pill);
    text-decoration: none;
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 1rem;
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 10px;
    transition: background-color 0.2s ease;
  }

  .cta-btn:hover {
    background-color: var(--color-gold-hover);
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .standard-item {
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 10px;
    }
  }
</style>

